Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 18:50:16 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(drilling): keep cross-drill topology invariant under
 roundoff

Coalesce only roundoff-sized radial rapids while preserving stationary pose changes. Replace raw-float chain hashes with fixed numeric references and extend moved-G54 regressions.

Fixes #151
